> oon) lwidth(thick)), ///
>     xline(`ab', lcolor(gs8) lwidth(medthick))                                
>                      ///
>     xline(0, lcolor(gs12) lpattern(dash))                                    
>                      ///
>     text(`=0.97*`ytop'' 0.152 "Monte Carlo distribution of ab-hat" "(`R' samp
> les): skewness `fsk'", ///
