Johnson-Neyman boundaries: W = -0.889 and W = -0.211

. di    "  theta(W) differs from zero for W < " %6.3f wlo " (negative) and W > 
> " %6.3f whi " (positive)"
  theta(W) differs from zero for W < -0.889 (negative) and W > -0.211 (positive
